1
00:00:00,815 --> 00:00:06,605
This video is for the executive manager. You will see the whole company at a glance:

2
00:00:06,605 --> 00:00:11,085
requests, spending, lab work and custody tools, for every branch.

3
00:00:11,536 --> 00:00:14,056
Sign in with your name and password.

4
00:00:17,003 --> 00:00:19,402
The Overview shows the key numbers:

5
00:00:19,402 --> 00:00:25,503
total requests, average fulfilment time, emergencies, the received rate, and open issues.

6
00:00:25,954 --> 00:00:29,774
Choose a month, or All time, and every number updates.

7
00:00:30,799 --> 00:00:36,299
The charts show the fulfilment time trend, each clinic, and the most requested items.

8
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:44,215
Reports compares branches, clinics and doctors: requests, value, approval time and dispatch time.

9
00:00:44,215 --> 00:00:47,140
Filter by branch, and export to Excel.

10
00:00:48,508 --> 00:00:53,528
You can also open any doctor's report with prices, for one month or cumulative.

11
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:59,810
Lab KPIs show turnaround, on-time rate, redos, and what the external labs cost.

12
00:01:00,282 --> 00:01:07,142
The Custody dashboard shows damaged and lost tools, repair cost, and any clinic below its standard.

13
00:01:07,593 --> 00:01:14,743
Workflow explains the full journey of a request, from the nurse to receipt, and who is responsible at each step.

14
00:01:15,194 --> 00:01:23,397
Doctors live shows every doctor's open requests by stage: doctor review, new, approved, in preparation and sent.

15
00:01:23,397 --> 00:01:28,084
It refreshes every minute. Tap any number to see those requests.

16
00:01:28,534 --> 00:01:32,410
Doctor survey shows the satisfaction results of each cycle:

17
00:01:32,410 --> 00:01:39,112
response rate, average stars, the recommend score, every question, branches, trends and written notes.

18
00:01:39,112 --> 00:01:43,514
While the survey is open, remind the doctors who have not answered.

19
00:01:43,964 --> 00:01:51,738
Doctor prices: by default, doctors see no prices. From this page you grant or withhold prices for each doctor.

20
00:01:51,738 --> 00:01:54,424
Every change is logged with your name.

21
00:01:54,875 --> 00:02:00,155
That's it. Everything you see is live, straight from the system. Thank you!
